      "statement": "{kunen2014set}}]\\label{axiom:foundation}\\index{axioms!foundation}\n    Every non-empty set has an element from which it is disjoint. That is,\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\forall x\\left(\\exists y(y \\in x) \\implies \\exists y\\left(y \\in x \\land \\neg\\exists z(z \\in x \\land z \\in y)\\right)\\right).\n    \\end{align*}",
