      "section": "A Topology for Orders",
      "statement": "\\label{cor:components-totally-ordered-by-arrival-index}\n    Let $(X, \\preceq)$ be a partially ordered set and let $\\bm{x} \\in \\mathscr{T}(X)$ be a tuple. Then, the set of comparability components $\\mathcal{K}(\\bm{x})$ is totally ordered by the relation \n    \\begin{align*}\n    K \\leq K^\\prime \\iff \\operatorname{arr}_{\\bm{x}}(K) \\leq \\operatorname{arr}_{\\bm{x}}(K^\\prime).\n    \\end{align*}",
