      "statement": "\\label{cor:iterated-single-stage-measurable}\n    For every $i \\in \\mathbb{N}_0$, the iterated single-stage clearing map $\\Phi^{(i)} : \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}}) \\to \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}})$ of Definition~\\ref{defn:iterated-single-stage-clearing} is Borel measurable.",
