      "statement": "\\label{cor:local-continuity-sorting}\n    Let $(X, \\preceq, d)$ be a partially ordered metric space. Let $(\\mathscr{T}(X),\\mathscr{d}_H)$ be the associated tuple Hausdorff space. For each $\\pi \\in \\mathscr{P}$ the mapping \n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\varsigma_\\pi &: \\mathscr{V}_\\pi \\to \\mathscr{S}(X, \\preceq),\\\\\n         \\bm{x}&\\mapsto \\bm{x}[\\pi],\n    \\end{align*}\n    is continuous, where both domain and codomain carry the subspace topologies inherited from $(\\mathscr{T}(X),\\mathscr{d}_H)$.",
