      "order": 53,
      "proofStatus": "verified",
      "section": "Clearing",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:best-price-and-tradeprice}\n    Let $U = [-9999,9999]\\times\\allowbreak (0,\\infty) \\times [0,1]$ and $O = \\bigsqcup_{\\kappa\\in\\{\\mathrm{buy},\\mathrm{sell}\\}} U$, let $\\preceq$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:price-time-priority-metric}, and let $\\mathsf{price} : U \\to [-9999,9999]$, $\\mathsf{quantity} : U \\to (0,\\infty)$, and $\\mathsf{time} : U \\to [0,1]$ denote the first, second, and third coordinate projections on $U$, respectively. For each $\\kappa \\in \\{\\mathrm{buy}, \\mathrm{sell}\\}$, the \\emph{best-price functional} $\\mathsf{best}_\\kappa:\\mathscr{T}(U) \\to [-10000, 10000]$ is defined by\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\mathsf{best}_\\kappa(\\bm{x}) = \\begin{cases}\n            10000 & \\bm{x} = \\bm{e} \\land \\kappa = \\mathrm{sell},\\\\\n            -10000 & \\bm{x} = \\bm{e} \\land \\kappa = \\mathrm{buy},\\\\\n            \\mathsf{price}(\\bm{x}(1)) & \\text{otherwise}.\n        \\end{cases}\n    \\end{align*}\n    For any $\\bm{m} \\in \\mathscr{S}(O, \\preceq)$ with $\\bm{b} = \\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}}(\\bm{m})$ and $\\bm{s} = \\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}}(\\bm{m})$ satisfying\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\mathsf{best}_{\\mathrm{buy}}(\\bm{b}) \\geq \\mathsf{best}_{\\mathrm{sell}}(\\bm{s}),\n    \\end{align*}\n    the \\emph{matched quantity} is $\\min(\\mathsf{quantity}(\\bm{b}(1)), \\mathsf{quantity}(\\bm{s}(1)))$, and for $\\kappa\\in\\{\\mathrm{buy},\\mathrm{sell}\\}$, the \\emph{transaction price} is defined by\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\mathsf{tradeprice}(\\bm{b},\\bm{s};\\kappa)\n        =\\begin{cases}\n            \\mathsf{price}(\\bm{s}(1)) & \\kappa=\\mathrm{buy},\\\\\n            \\mathsf{price}(\\bm{b}(1)) & \\kappa=\\mathrm{sell}.\n        \\end{cases}\n    \\end{align*}",
      "status": "verified",
