      "statement": "\\label{defn:cancel}\n    Let $X$ be a non-empty set and $\\mathscr{T}(X)$ be the associated tuple space. Let $\\mathscr{F}(\\mathbb{N})$ denote the set of finite subsets of $\\mathbb{N}$. Define the operation $\\ominus: \\mathscr{T}(X)\\times \\mathscr{F}(\\mathbb{N}) \\to \\mathscr{T}(X)$ by  \n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\bm{x} \\ominus \\eta = \\bm{x}[\\mathrm{domain}(\\bm{x})\\setminus\\eta]. \n    \\end{align*}",
