      "mappedToLean": true,
      "order": 63,
      "proofStatus": "verified",
      "section": "Clearing",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:clearing-operator}\n    Let $O$ and $\\preceq$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:price-time-priority-metric}, let $\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}}$ and $\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}}$ be the separation operators of Definition~\\ref{defn:separation-operators}, let $\\Phi^{(i)}$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:iterated-single-stage-clearing}, and let $\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{buy}}$ and $\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{sell}}$ be the retagging maps of Definition~\\ref{defn:retagging}. The \\emph{clearing operator}\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\mathsf{C}: \\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq) \\to \\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq)\n    \\end{align*}\n    is defined for $\\bm{m}\\in\\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq)$ by setting\n    \\begin{align*}\n        (\\bm{b}^\\star,\\bm{s}^\\star)\n        &=\n        \\Phi^{(\\max\\{\\ell(\\bm{m})-1,0\\})}\n        \\left(\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}}\\bm{m},\n        \\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}}\\bm{m}\\right),\\\\\n        \\mathsf{C}(\\bm{m})\n        &=(\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{buy}}\\bm{b}^\\star)\n        \\oplus(\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{sell}}\\bm{s}^\\star).\n    \\end{align*}",
      "status": "verified",
