      "mappedToLean": true,
      "order": 75,
      "proofStatus": "verified",
      "section": "The Visible Book",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:depth-restricted-step}\n    Let $O$ and $\\preceq$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:price-time-priority-metric}, let $\\varsigma:\\mathscr{T}(O)\\to\\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq)$ be the minimum sorting map, let $\\mathsf{C}$ be the clearing operator of Definition~\\ref{defn:clearing-operator}, and let $\\Pi^{\\mathscr{B}}$ be the visible projection of Definition~\\ref{defn:visible-order-book}. For any $\\bm{m}_{t-}\\in\\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq)$ and any composite action $\\bm{c}_t\\in\\mathscr{C}(O)$, define\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\widetilde{\\bm{m}}_t = \\varsigma\\!\\left(\\bm{m}_{t-} \\lhd \\bm{c}_t\\right),\n        \\qquad\n        \\bm{m}^\\prime = \\mathsf{C}(\\Pi^{\\mathscr{B}}\\widetilde{\\bm{m}}_t),\n    \\end{align*}\n    and the tail sub-tuples\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\bm{b}^{\\mathrm{latent}}_{t} &= (\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}} \\widetilde{\\bm{m}}_t)[\\operatorname{domain}(\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}} \\widetilde{\\bm{m}}_t) \\setminus \\{1,\\dots, 100\\} ],\\\\\n        \\bm{s}^{\\mathrm{latent}}_{t} &= (\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}} \\widetilde{\\bm{m}}_t)[\\operatorname{domain}(\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}} \\widetilde{\\bm{m}}_t) \\setminus \\{1,\\dots, 100\\} ].\n    \\end{align*}\n    Setting\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\bm{b}_t &= \\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}} \\bm{m}^\\prime \\oplus \\bm{b}^{\\mathrm{latent}}_{t},\\\\\n        \\bm{s}_t &= \\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}} \\bm{m}^\\prime \\oplus \\bm{s}^{\\mathrm{latent}}_{t},\n    \\end{align*}\n    the \\emph{depth-restricted step operator} $\\unlhd:\\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq)\\times\\mathscr{C}(O)\\to\\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq)$ is defined by\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\bm{m}_{t-}\\unlhd\\bm{c}_t = \\bm{m}_t = (\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{buy}}\\bm{b}_t)\n        \\oplus(\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{sell}}\\bm{s}_t).\n    \\end{align*}",
      "status": "verified",
      "thesisIssue": null,
      "thesisProof": null,
