      "statement": "\\label{defn:g-delta}\\index{G-delta set@$G_\\delta$ set}\n    Let $(X,\\mathcal{T})$ be a topological space. A subset $A \\subseteq X$ is called a $G_\\delta$ set if there exist open sets $U_1, U_2, \\dots \\in \\mathcal{T}$ such that $A = \\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb{N}} U_n$.",
