      "section": "A Topology for Orders",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:index-comparable}\nLet $(X,\\preceq)$ be a partially ordered set and let $\\bm{x}\\in\\mathscr{T}(X)$. We define the relation $\\overset{\\bm{x}}{\\leftrightsquigarrow}$ on $\\mathrm{domain}(\\bm{x})$ by\n\\begin{align*}\n    i \\overset{\\bm{x}}{\\leftrightsquigarrow} j\n\\iff (\\bm{x}(i)\\preceq \\bm{x}(j))\\ \\lor\\ (\\bm{x}(j)\\preceq \\bm{x}(i)).\n\\end{align*}",
