      "section": "Clearing",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:iterated-single-stage-clearing}\n    Let $U = [-9999,9999]\\times(0,\\infty)\\times[0,1]$ and let $\\Phi$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:single-stage-clearing-map}. For each $i\\in\\mathbb{N}_0$, the \\emph{$i$-fold iterated single-stage clearing map}\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\Phi^{(i)} : \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}}) \\to \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}})\n    \\end{align*}\n    is defined recursively by\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\Phi^{(0)} &= \\mathrm{Id},\\\\\n        \\Phi^{(1)} &= \\Phi, \\\\\n        \\Phi^{(i)} &= \\Phi^{(i-1)} \\circ \\Phi, \\qquad i > 1.\n    \\end{align*}",
