      "section": "Primitive Actions",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:pairing}\\index{pairing}\n    Let $(X, \\preceq)$ be a totally ordered set. Define for each $\\xi \\in \\mathscr{F}(X)$ the associated tuple $\\xi^\\dagger : \\{i \\in \\mathbb{N} \\mid i \\leq |\\xi|\\} \\to X$ by the recursive expression\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\xi^\\dagger(i) = \\min \\{x \\in \\xi \\mid x \\notin \\{\\xi^\\dagger(j) \\mid j <i\\}\\},\n    \\end{align*}\n    where the minimum is taken with respect to the total order, $\\preceq$.",
