      "proofStatus": "verified",
      "section": "Clearing",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:retagging}\n    Let $(X_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\in A}$ be a family of non-empty sets and let $X=\\bigsqcup_{\\alpha\\in A}X_\\alpha$. For each $\\alpha\\in A$, define the \\emph{$\\alpha$-retagging map}\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\iota_\\alpha:X_\\alpha&\\to X,\\\\\n        x&\\mapsto(x,\\alpha),\n    \\end{align*}\n    and its tuple-wise extension $\\bm{\\iota}_\\alpha:\\mathscr{T}(X_\\alpha)\\to\\mathscr{T}(X)$ by\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\bm{\\iota}_\\alpha\\bm{x}=\\iota_\\alpha\\circ\\bm{x}.\n    \\end{align*}",
