      "proofStatus": "verified",
      "section": "Clearing",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:single-stage-clearing-map}\n    Let $U = [-9999,9999]\\times(0,\\infty)\\times[0,1]$, and let $\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}}$, $\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}}$, and $T$ be as in Proposition~\\ref{prop:crossing-set-closed}. The \\emph{single-stage clearing map} is the operator\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\Phi&:\n        \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\n        \\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}})\n        \\to\n        \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\n        \\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}}),\\\\\n        \\Phi(\\bm{b},\\bm{s})\n        &=\n        \\begin{cases}\n            (\\bm{b},\\bm{s}),\n            & (\\bm{b},\\bm{s})\\notin T,\\\\[3pt]\n            \\left(\\bm{b}\\ominus\\{1\\},\n            \\bm{s}\\circledast\\{(1,(p_{\\bm{s}},q_{\\bm{s}}-q_{\\bm{b}},t_{\\bm{s}}))\\}\\right),\n            & (\\bm{b},\\bm{s})\\in T,\\ q_{\\bm{b}} < q_{\\bm{s}},\\\\[3pt]\n            \\left(\\bm{b}\\circledast\\{(1,(p_{\\bm{b}},q_{\\bm{b}}-q_{\\bm{s}},t_{\\bm{b}}))\\},\n            \\bm{s}\\ominus\\{1\\}\\right),\n            & (\\bm{b},\\bm{s})\\in T,\\ q_{\\bm{b}} > q_{\\bm{s}},\\\\[3pt]\n            \\left(\\bm{b}\\ominus\\{1\\},\\bm{s}\\ominus\\{1\\}\\right),\n            & (\\bm{b},\\bm{s})\\in T,\\ q_{\\bm{b}} = q_{\\bm{s}},\n        \\end{cases}\n    \\end{align*}\n    where, for any non-empty tuple $\\bm{x}\\in\\mathscr{T}(U)$,\n    \\begin{align*}\n        (p_{\\bm{x}}, q_{\\bm{x}}, t_{\\bm{x}}) = (\\mathsf{price}(\\bm{x}(1)), \\mathsf{quantity}(\\bm{x}(1)), \\mathsf{time}(\\bm{x}(1))).\n    \\end{align*}",
      "status": "verified",
      "thesisIssue": null,
      "thesisProof": null,
