      "mappedToLean": true,
      "order": 182,
      "proofStatus": "verified",
      "section": "The Visible Book",
      "statement": "\\label{defn:visible-order-book}\n    Let $O$ and $\\preceq$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:price-time-priority-metric}, let $\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}}$ and $\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}}$ be the separation operators of Definition~\\ref{defn:separation-operators}, and let $\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{buy}}$ and $\\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{sell}}$ be the retagging maps of Definition~\\ref{defn:retagging}. The \\emph{visible tuple space} is the subset\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\mathscr{B} = \\{\\bm{m} \\in \\mathscr{S}(O, \\preceq) \\mid \\max(\\ell(\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}} \\bm{m}), \\ell(\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}} \\bm{m})) \\leq 100\\},\n    \\end{align*}\n    and the \\emph{visible projection} $\\Pi^{\\mathscr{B}} : \\mathscr{S}(O, \\preceq) \\to \\mathscr{B}$ is defined by\n    \\begin{align}\\label{eq:intraday-visible-projection}\n        \\Pi^{\\mathscr{B}}(\\bm{m})\n        &=\n        \\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{buy}}\\!\\left((\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{buy}} \\bm{m})[\\{1, \\dots, 100\\}]\\right)\n        \\notag\\\\\n        &\\qquad\\oplus\n        \\bm{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{sell}}\\!\\left((\\bm{\\Pi}_{\\mathrm{sell}} \\bm{m})[\\{1, \\dots, 100\\}]\\right).\n    \\end{align}",
      "status": "verified",
