            "text": "\\textbf{Proof of \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-1} and \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-2}:} It suffices to show \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-1}, as \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-2} is analogous. Let $\\varepsilon \\in (0,1)$ satisfy $\\rho(\\xi,\\eta)<\\varepsilon$. By the definition of the Prokhorov metric, there exists $\\theta \\in (0,\\varepsilon)$ such that\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\xi(B) \\leq \\eta(B^\\theta) + \\theta\n    \\end{align*}\n    for every $B \\in \\mathcal{B}(X)$. Since $B^\\theta \\subseteq B^\\varepsilon$, it follows that\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\xi(B) \\leq \\eta(B^\\varepsilon) + \\theta.\n    \\end{align*}\n    Now $\\xi(B)$ and $\\eta(B^\\varepsilon)$ are integers and $\\theta < 1$, so the above inequality implies\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\xi(B) \\leq \\eta(B^\\varepsilon),\n    \\end{align*}\n    which proves \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-1}.",
