            "text": "\\textbf{Proof of \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-3}:} Apply \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-1} and \\eqref{eq:lem-helpful-point-process-2} with $B=X$. Since $X^\\varepsilon = X$, we obtain\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\xi(X) \\leq \\eta(X) \\quad \\text{and} \\quad \\eta(X) \\leq \\xi(X),\n    \\end{align*}\n    which implies that $\\xi(X) = \\eta(X)$.",
