            "references": [],
            "text": "We first show boundedness. Fix $x_0\\in X$ and suppose, for contradiction, that $d(x_0,f(t_k))\\to\\infty$ along a sequence $(t_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb{N}}\\subseteq[a,b]$. Since $[a,b]$ is compact, we may pass to a monotone subsequence converging to some $t\\in[a,b]$, and since $f(t)$ is a single point, we may further assume that the subsequence is strictly monotone.",
