      "statement": "\\label{lem:regular-paths-bounded-borel}\n    Let $a,b\\in\\mathbb{R}$ with $a<b$, let $(X,d)$ be a metric space, and let $f\\in C([a,b];X)\\cup D^+([a,b];X)\\cup D^-([a,b];X)$. Then $f([a,b])$ is a bounded subset of $X$, and $f$ is Borel measurable.",
