      "statement": "\\label{prop:aa-es-convex-simplex}\n    Let $\\mathcal{C}$ be a non-empty finite index set. For any fixed family of vectors $(\\bm{y}_e)_{e\\in\\mathcal{C}}$ in $\\mathbb{R}^{33}$ and target vector $\\bm{y}_q\\in\\mathbb{R}^{33}$, the map $\\pi \\mapsto \\mathsf{ES}(\\pi;\\bm{y}_q)$ of Definition~\\ref{defn:aa-training-energy-score} is a convex quadratic function on the probability simplex $\\Delta(\\mathcal{C}) = \\{\\pi\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal{C}} \\mid \\sum_{e\\in\\mathcal{C}}\\pi(e)=1\\}$.",
      "status": "verified",
