            "text": "Because the weights $w_j$ in~\\eqref{eq:quantity-pava} are strictly positive, the quadratic forms $\\sum_{j=-m}^{m}w_j(x_j-\\widetilde{a}_j)^2$ and $\\sum_{j=-m+1}^{m}(y_j-\\widetilde{c}_j)^2$ are squared norms induced by weighted Euclidean inner products.",
