            "references": [],
            "text": "By the Hilbert projection theorem on finite-dimensional spaces, the metric projections $\\bm{q}(\\widetilde{z})$ onto $C_q$ and $\\bm{p}(\\widetilde{z})$ onto $C_p$ exist and are unique.",
