            "text": "We must show that the integral $\\int_{-1}^{1}\\bigl(\\phi_a(u)\\phi_{a'}(u)+\\pi_c(u)\\pi_{c'}(u)\\bigr)\\,\\mathrm{d}u$ coincides with the sum in~\\eqref{eq:numerical-inner-product}.",
            "title": "Proof step 1"
