            "text": "By construction, $\\Delta\\widetilde{q}_h \\in \\mathcal{R}$ and the cumulative sums satisfy $\\widetilde{q}_h = q_{\\mathrm{start}} + \\sum_{r=1}^h \\Delta\\widetilde{q}_r = \\alpha^{-1}q_h \\in \\mathcal{G}$ for all $h$, with $\\widetilde{q}_{24} = q_{\\mathrm{stop}}$.",
