      "section": "Aggregation and Executable Volume",
      "statement": "\\label{prop:executable-volume-uniform-price}\n    Let $\\bm{p}^s\\in\\mathscr{S}(\\mathbb{R},\\leq)$ and $\\bm{p}^b\\in\\mathscr{S}(\\mathbb{R},\\geq)$, let $\\bm{q}^s,\\bm{q}^b\\in\\mathscr{T}([0,\\infty))$ with $\\ell(\\bm{q}^s)=\\ell(\\bm{p}^s)$ and $\\ell(\\bm{q}^b)=\\ell(\\bm{p}^b)$, let $\\bm{Q}^s=\\bm{\\Sigma}(\\bm{q}^s)$ and $\\bm{Q}^b=\\bm{\\Sigma}(\\bm{q}^b)$, and define, for $p\\in\\mathbb{R}$,\n    \\begin{align*}\n        S(p)=\\sum_{i\\in\\mathrm{domain}(\\bm{p}^s):\\,\\bm{p}^s(i)\\leq p}\\bm{q}^s(i),\n        \\qquad\n        D(p)=\\sum_{j\\in\\mathrm{domain}(\\bm{p}^b):\\,\\bm{p}^b(j)\\geq p}\\bm{q}^b(j).\n    \\end{align*}\n    Then\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\mathscr{Q}((\\bm{Q}^s,\\bm{p}^s), (\\bm{Q}^b,\\bm{p}^b))=\\max_{p\\in\\mathbb{R}}\\min\\bigl(S(p),D(p)\\bigr).\n    \\end{align*}",
      "status": "verified",
