            "text": "To prove (ii), suppose in addition that $\\bm{p}(i)\\neq\\bm{p}^\\prime(j)$ for all $(i,j)\\in\\mathrm{domain}(\\bm{p})\\times\\mathrm{domain}(\\bm{p}^\\prime)$. Then every $(i,j)\\in\\mathfrak{I}(\\bm{p},\\bm{p}^\\prime)$ satisfies the strict inequality $\\bm{p}(i)<\\bm{p}^\\prime(j)$, and hence $\\bm{p}_k(i)<\\bm{p}^\\prime_k(j)$ for all sufficiently large $k$. Enlarging $K$ if necessary, we obtain $\\mathfrak{I}(\\bm{p}_k,\\bm{p}^\\prime_k) = \\mathfrak{I}(\\bm{p},\\bm{p}^\\prime)$ for all $k \\geq K$, which yields\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\lim_{k\\to\\infty} \\mathscr{Q}(z_k) = \\lim_{k\\to\\infty} g_k = \\mathscr{Q}(z),\n    \\end{align*}\n    establishing continuity at $z$.",
