            "text": "First, we show that $\\Phi$ is well-defined. If $[x]_{\\overset{\\varphi}{\\sim}} = [x']_{\\overset{\\varphi}{\\sim}}$, then $x \\overset{\\varphi}{\\sim} x'$, hence $\\varphi(x)=\\varphi(x')$. Therefore the value $\\Phi([x]_{\\overset{\\varphi}{\\sim}})$ does not depend on the chosen representative.",
