            "references": [],
            "text": "We now show injectivity. We must show that \n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\Phi(x_\\varphi) = \\Phi(x^\\prime_\\varphi) \\implies x_\\varphi = x^\\prime_\\varphi.\n    \\end{align*}\n    Let $x_\\varphi, x^\\prime_\\varphi \\in X_\\varphi$ be arbitrary. By the definition of $\\Phi$, we have that $\\Phi(x_\\varphi) = \\Phi(x^\\prime_\\varphi)$ implies that $\\varphi(x) = \\varphi(x^\\prime)$, which implies that $x \\overset{\\varphi}{\\sim} x^\\prime$, and hence $x_\\varphi = x^\\prime_\\varphi$, as desired.",
