            "text": "We must show that $\\mathsf{C}_{\\mathbb{N}}$ takes values in the sorted space $\\mathscr{S}(O\\times\\mathbb{N},\\preceq_{\\mathbb{N}})$, is Borel measurable, preserves the distinct-identifier subspace $\\mathscr{S}(O\\times\\mathbb{N},\\preceq_{\\mathbb{N}})\\cap\\mathscr{T}_{\\neq}(O\\times\\mathbb{N})$, and satisfies \\eqref{eq:identifier-clearing-commutation}.",
