            "references": [
              "exmp:identifier-coordinates"
            ],
            "text": "To establish the Borel measurability of $\\mathsf{C}_{\\mathbb{N}}$, observe that the identifier coordinate on $O\\times\\mathbb{N}$ is locally constant under the metric of Example~\\ref{exmp:identifier-coordinates}.",
            "title": "Proof step 4"
