            "references": [
              "prop:single-stage-execution"
            ],
            "text": "Consequently, the crossing set on $U\\times\\mathbb{N}$ is closed and the single-stage clearing map $\\Phi_{\\mathbb{N}}$ on $\\mathscr{S}(U\\times\\mathbb{N},\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}}_{\\mathbb{N}})\\times\\mathscr{S}(U\\times\\mathbb{N},\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}}_{\\mathbb{N}})$ is Borel measurable by the exact partition argument of Proposition~\\ref{prop:single-stage-execution}.",
