            "references": [],
            "text": "Next, suppose that $\\bm{m}\\in\\mathscr{S}(O\\times\\mathbb{N},\\preceq_{\\mathbb{N}})\\cap\\mathscr{T}_{\\neq}(O\\times\\mathbb{N})$ has distinct identifiers. Each single-stage clearing step either leaves the pair of sides unchanged, deletes an order at index $1$, or reduces its quantity while retaining its original identifier. Since no new identifiers are created and no existing identifier is duplicated, $\\mathsf{C}_{\\mathbb{N}}(\\bm{m})\\in\\mathscr{T}_{\\neq}(O\\times\\mathbb{N})$.",
