            "references": [],
            "text": "For reflexivity, note that $x = x$ implies $x \\preceq_I x$ for every $x \\in X$ by definition. For antisymmetry, suppose that $x \\preceq_I x^\\prime$ and $x^\\prime \\preceq_I x$ for some $x, x^\\prime \\in X$.",
