            "text": "Each block $\\varsigma(K_r)$ is sorted by construction. Moreover, if $r < s$, then every element of $K_r$ is incomparable with every element of $K_s$ by Proposition~\\ref{prop:components-partition-incomp}. Hence no element from the later block can be strictly smaller than an element from the earlier block. Therefore, the concatenation of the sorted blocks is again sorted, so $\\varsigma_{\\mathrm{min}}(\\bm{x}) \\in \\mathscr{S}(X,\\preceq)$.",
