      "statement": "\\label{prop:minimum-sorting-map-is-sorting-map}\n    Let $(X, \\preceq)$ be a partially ordered set. Then, the mapping $\\varsigma_{\\mathrm{min}}:\\mathscr{T}(X) \\to \\mathscr{S}(X,\\preceq)$ defined by sorting each comparability component separately and concatenating the results is a sorting map.",
