            "text": "First, fix $j\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$ and binary vectors $x_{\\cdot,j}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathcal{R}}$ and $y_{\\cdot,j}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathcal{A}}$. If there exists $\\beta_j\\in\\{0,1\\}$ such that $\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal{R}} x_{i,j}\\le\\beta_j$ and $\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal{A}} y_{u,j}\\le 1-\\beta_j$, then adding the two inequalities gives $\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal{R}} x_{i,j}+\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal{A}} y_{u,j}\\le 1$.",
