            "text": "First, note that $\\mathfrak{m}^\\pi$ is well-defined, as every $\\bm{x}^\\prime \\in \\bm{x}^\\pi$ satisfies $\\mathfrak{m}(\\bm{x}^\\prime) = \\mathfrak{m}(\\bm{x})$. By Proposition~\\ref{prop:tuple-measure-surjective}, the mapping is surjective. It therefore remains to prove injectivity.",
