            "text": "We must show first that the maps $Z:\\mathscr{L}\\to\\allowbreak L^2([-1,1];\\mathbb{R}^2)$ and $\\bm{m}\\mapsto P_{\\bm{m}}(0)$ are Borel measurable with respect to $\\mathcal{B}(\\mathscr{L})$, and second that $\\mathbb{E}\\bigl[\\lVert Z(\\bm{M})\\rVert_{L^2([-1,1];\\mathbb{R}^2)}^2\\bigr]<\\infty$ whenever $\\mathbb{E}[D(\\bm{M})^2]<\\infty$.",
