            "text": "Finally, on each cell of the combined finite Borel partition of $\\mathscr{L}_{n,n^\\prime}$, the numbers $L$ and $U$ are constant, and $\\Psi(P_{\\bm{m}})$ linearly interpolates the endpoints of the $j$th positive-width piece over $[(j-1)/U,j/U]$ on the positive side and over $[j/L,(j+1)/L]$ on the negative side.",
