            "text": "The completed graph of $E^{\\bm{m}}$ is therefore the union of the segments from $(x_{k-1},E^{\\bm{m}}(x_{k-1}+))$ to $(x_k,E^{\\bm{m}}(x_k-))$, for $k=1,\\dots,K$, and the vertical segments $\\{x_k\\}\\times[E^{\\bm{m}}(x_k-),E^{\\bm{m}}(x_k+)]$, for $k=0,\\dots,K$, where $E^{\\bm{m}}(x_0-)=-b_*$ and $E^{\\bm{m}}(x_K+)=s_*$.",
