      "statement": "\\label{prop:separation-preserves-price-time}\n    Let $U = [-9999,9999]\\times (0,\\infty) \\times [0,1]$, let $O = \\bigsqcup_{\\kappa\\in\\{\\mathrm{buy},\\mathrm{sell}\\}} U$, and let $\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}}$, $\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}}$, and $\\preceq$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:price-time-priority-metric}. Then, for each $\\kappa \\in \\{\\mathrm{buy}, \\mathrm{sell}\\}$, the separation operator $\\bm{\\Pi}_\\kappa$ of Definition~\\ref{defn:separation-operators} maps $\\mathscr{S}(O, \\preceq)$ into $\\mathscr{S}(U, \\preceq^\\kappa)$, that is,\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\bm{\\Pi}_\\kappa : \\mathscr{S}(O, \\preceq) \\to \\mathscr{S}([-9999,9999]\\times (0,\\infty) \\times [0,1], \\preceq^\\kappa).\n    \\end{align*}",
