      "section": "Clearing",
      "statement": "\\label{prop:single-stage-execution}\n    Let $U = [-9999,9999]\\times(0,\\infty)\\times[0,1]$ and let $\\Phi$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:single-stage-clearing-map}. Then the single-stage clearing map\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\Phi:\n        \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\n        \\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}})\n        \\to\n        \\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{buy}})\n        \\times\\mathscr{S}(U,\\preceq^{\\mathrm{sell}})\n    \\end{align*}\n    is Borel measurable.",
