            "text": "Let $\\xi\\in\\mathcal{N}(X)$. If $\\xi=0$, then the empty tuple $\\bm{e}$ satisfies $\\mathfrak{m}(\\bm{e})=\\xi$.\n    Hence assume $\\xi\\neq 0$.",
