      "section": "Topological Spaces",
      "statement": "Let $X$ and $Y$ be sets, and let $\\mathcal{B}_X$ and $\\mathcal{B}_Y$ be topological bases on $X$ and $Y$, respectively. Define\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\mathcal{B}_X \\otimes \\mathcal{B}_Y = \\{B_X \\times B_Y \\mid B_X \\in \\mathcal{B}_X,\\ B_Y \\in \\mathcal{B}_Y\\}.\n    \\end{align*}\n    Then $\\mathcal{B}_X \\otimes \\mathcal{B}_Y$ is a topological base on $X \\times Y$.",
      "status": "verified",
