      "section": "Clearing",
      "statement": "\\label{thm:clearing-measurable}\n    Let $O$ and $\\preceq$ be as in Definition~\\ref{defn:price-time-priority-metric}. Then the clearing operator $\\mathsf{C}: \\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq) \\to \\mathscr{S}(O,\\preceq)$ of Definition~\\ref{defn:clearing-operator} is Borel measurable.",
      "status": "verified",
