            "text": "First, note that if $f$ is measurable, then $f\\restriction_{X_n}$ is immediately seen to be measurable by definition of the trace $\\sigma$-algebra. Therefore, we will prove that if $f\\restriction_{X_n}$ is measurable for each $n\\in \\mathbb{N}$, then $f$ is measurable.",
