      "statement": "\\label{thm:szpilrajn}\\index{Szpilrajn extension theorem}\n    Let $(X, \\preceq)$ be a partially ordered set. Then, there exists a total order, $\\leq$, on $X$ such that\n    \\begin{align*}\n        \\forall x,x^\\prime\\in X : x \\preceq x^\\prime \\implies x \\leq x^\\prime.\n    \\end{align*}",
