            "text": "Finally, for property \\eqref{property:layers-clopen-borel}, each layer $X^n$ is open, since by Theorem~\\ref{thm:tuple-space-properties}\\eqref{eq:tuple-length} it is the union of the open balls of radius $1$ about its elements, and closed, since its complement is the union of the other layers.",
